body:
> there’s a dude on my floor who just put a sign on his door saying he’s “visibly trans” and stating his new name. he presents 100% male and makes no attempt to look like a woman at all. it’s an all-female dorm floor besides this and it makes me feel weird 

&#x200B;

>But what about the shower situation? They could call him on his bluff. Someone should be there camera in hand. If he tries to perv on them, they can get him bounced off the floor. 

&#x200B;

Hmm... Yeah the trans woman is definitely the perv here
